# ARIA Agent Context

- Read first: `AGENTS.md`, `ARIA_WORKFLOW_CHECKLIST.md`, `ARIA_PRD.md`.
- Prioritize unchecked items in `ARIA_WORKFLOW_CHECKLIST.md` over new features.
- Keep changes privacy-first and local-first; avoid paid dependencies.
- Treat tray popup UX and interrupt gating as core product behavior.
- When making implementation changes, run:
  - `pytest aria-backend/tests -q`
  - `cd aria-desktop && npm run build`
  - `cd aria-mobile && npx expo export --platform android --output-dir dist-test`
- If behavior differs from PRD, align to PRD and document the adjustment.
